---
layout: base.njk
title: "Projects | Benedict's Portfolio"
permalink: /projects/index.html
---
<section>
    <h1>My Projects</h1>
    <p>These projects come from my web development, operating systems, and music classes. Choose one to read what I worked on and what I learned.</p>
    {% for project in projects %}
    <article>
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ project.context }}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ ('/projects/' + project.slug + '/') | url }}">{{ project.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ project.summary }}</p>
        <p><strong>Tools:</strong> {{ project.tools | join(', ') }}</p>
        <p><a href="{{ ('/projects/' + project.slug + '/') | url }}">Read about this project</a></p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
</section>
